name kantlipsum
category Package
revision 51727
shortdesc Generate sentences in Kant's style
longdesc The package spits out sentences in Kantian style; the text is
longdesc provided by the Kant generator for Python by Mark Pilgrim,
longdesc described in the book "Dive into Python". The package is
longdesc modelled on lipsum, and may be used for similar purposes.
